    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MINDY: It’ll get out. It always gets out by the second or third killing.\nAMBER: Jesus, Mindy - there wasn’t a first killing. Tara’s alive.\nMINDY: Hm. I mean, she could still die-",
      "MINDY: Or the killer could come back for her-\nLIV: Can you please tell your sister to stop talking?\nMINDY: I’m just saying, something’s different this time.",
      "AMBER: Tara’s awake, she just texted. I’m going to the hospital. You coming?\nLIV: Can’t, but I’ll meet you later.",
      "SAM: Where’s Mom?\nTARA: She was here earlier-\nAMBER: For all of ten minutes. Look, Tara’s really tired, and there are like a lot of people in here, so...\nTARA: It’s okay. I want her to stay.",
      "AMBER: Tara made the first move, bud. The heart wants what it wants.\nMINDY: Hm. Motive."
    ]
  },
